        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/koga/{size}/2058_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-12-16T08:28:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Could think of it this way. The Informant reacts to a card being played, Hairtrigger reflexes reacts to a target entering play. For the card to become a target, it has to have it's text active, otherwise it has no HP. So The Informant activates as a result of the action of playing a card, but Hairtrigger Reflexes needs a target to enter play to activate.</p>",
