        "created_at": "2012-12-16T13:14:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Let's imagine for the moment that the Informant causes Villain cards to be played first. I'm playing Expatriette, and I play an RPG Launcher from hand because I want to destroy, say, some annoying Paparazzi. The Chairman plays Rook City is Mine, and that brings a Hostage Situation into play? Can I destroy the Hostage Situation instead?</p>",
