      {
        "id": 49567,
        "name": "pwatson1974",
        "username": "pwatson1974",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pwatson1974/{size}/1925_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-12-16T18:53:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I would say yes you can. You paly the card, nothing on the card exists yet. This triggers the Inforamnt who brigns out Rook City is Mine. this brings out Hostage situation. You now resolve the text on the card which menas you now pick your target.</p><p>I tend to play the other way round with text on the card resolving before text off the cards. But I'm not sure I'm 100% following that rule.</p>",
